note A step's id: six base36 digits of an FNV-1a hash of a seed, moved past ids the tour already holds by hashing again with a counter; ShortId::fresh does the hashing, shared with comment ids. add_step seeds it with the tour name, file, symbol, offsets and parent id. The digits spread new steps across the file, and two branches that add the same step add the same id and the same lines.

